## Notes

This repository is for educational purposes and experimentation with Probot. As you learn and build, remember to:
- Keep your `.env` file secure (never commit it!)
- Test your apps thoroughly before deploying
- Follow GitHub's best practices for Apps
- Respect rate limits and API usage guidelines

Happy building! 🤖
